OL,5,G1700 A Christmas Carol
OL,6,     FThe late Patrick Stewart stars as
OL,7,     FEbenezer Scrooge in Dickens's
OL,8,     Fclassic festive tale of family,
OL,9,     Fcompassion and the uplifting power
