OL,5,G2155 A 70s Christmas: Those Were the
OL,6,G     Days
OL,7,     FTake a trip down memory lane to
OL,8,     Frediscover what Christmas was like
OL,9,     Fin the 70s. Plus, we challenge a
OL,10,     Ffamily to put away smart phones
OL,11,     Fand immerse themselves in a 70s
OL,12,     FChristmas!
OL,13,G2320 The Greatest TV of the '70s
OL,14,     FThis two-hour celebration features
OL,15,     Fthe very best TV from the 1970s:
OL,16,     Ffrom fabulous comedians and
OL,17,     Fsitcoms to dramas such as I,
OL,18,     FClaudius, and glorious game shows
OL,19,     Flike The Generation Game.
